{"ID":"20240205170447-7pc6ibu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205170447-7pc6ibu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170447-7pc6ibu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102912-abiiu3w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607130333-xhv8hvb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619162614-d2ghf01\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"074蛇床子","type":"doc","updated":"20240807170832"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102912-abiiu3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102912-abiiu3w","updated":"20240206102921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河北、广西、浙江、山东等地。\n【性状】\t双悬果细小，呈椭圆形，长2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4mm，直径约2mm。表面灰黄色或灰褐色，顶端有2枚向外弯曲的柱基，基部偶有细梗。悬果瓣的背面有薄而突起的纵棱5条，接合面平坦，有2条棕色略突起的纵棱线。果皮松脆；种子细小，灰棕色，显油性。气香，味辛凉，有麻舌感。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温，有小毒。\n【功效】\t解毒杀虫 燥湿 祛风。用于；外治外阴湿疹，妇人阴痒 滴虫性阴道炎 湿疹疥癣 ；寒湿带下 ； 湿痹腰痛 ；肾虚阳痿； 宫冷不孕 。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102913-s16nzl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102913-s16nzl0","updated":"20240206102913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102913-lb3oxbt.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205170620-mpelk8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170620-mpelk8f","updated":"20240205170620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇床子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇床子-20240205170620-02kklrr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619162537-m4tsek4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619162537-m4tsek4","updated":"20240619162537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 673px;","style":"width: 663px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇床子1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇床子1-20240619162537-n2xfenj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 663px;\" parent-style=\"width: 673px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240619165105-9ptckxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619165105-9ptckxw","updated":"20240807170331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 579px;","style":"width: 569px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇床子8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇床子8-20240619165108-4seye9t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 569px;\" parent-style=\"width: 579px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807170800-3u1g6ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807170800-3u1g6ah","updated":"20240807170800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 569px;","style":"width: 559px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇床子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇床子-20240807170453-vb8v587.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"wid